# N4 (LMX_semantics.ru.md #fields: the data scanner sees the direct root heads only, a root if: is one head if;
# next_core_tasks_v3.md N4-U U1): the int: y 5 inside the root if body of D is not a field of D, although it stands
# first. y is the root y of D, and the bare y of S writes it: D\y becomes 2. A reading that takes the first y in
# structural order writes the if body instead (D\y keeps 9); one that counts heads inside inline bodies throws. Entry 7.
S:
    int: y 2
end: S
D:
    int: c 1
    if: c = 1
        int: y 5
    int: y 9
end: D
call: S D
int: r 81
if: D\y = 2 && D\c = 1
    r: 7
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: r; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
